# Keeps the `local-nupkgs` NuGet source directory present on fresh checkouts.
# nuget.config declares <add key="local-nupkgs" value="nupkgs" />; without this
# tracked file the directory is absent on a clean CI clone and `dotnet restore`
# fails with NU1301 ("the local source doesn't exist"). Real packages still
# resolve from nuget.org; this only guarantees the declared source dir exists.
